      "writtenOn": "2015-11-04T02:19:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m confused why this isn\u0027t +\u003d\n\nAre custom RO objs only defined by chip/*/build.mk?  What happens if we need to add some from board/*/build.mk?  Or are we guaranteed those .mk files are included later?\n\nI think it\u0027s likely that chip/stm32/build.mk would have multiple custom-ro_objs for different boards, given the large diversity of use of that chip, which seems to imply maybe this list should be in board/*/build.mk.\n\n(Also, why is it mixing - and _?  custom_ro_objs or custom-ro-objs would be less typo-prone.)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 41,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 41,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "6826e0dc471d4c7ae8c97bfdf530ed7b2f5c6644",
